    "text": "By WCJB Staff ,\n57 minutes ago LIVE OAK, Fla. (WCJB) - Suwannee County commissioners are taking back oversight of emergency management from the sheriff’s office in a unanimous decision. In a special meeting on Wednesday, county commissioners gave the sheriff’s office a 90-day notice, which is required under an agreement. The county board chair... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
